    "text": "kadn.com\nwebsite\nEunice\nEunice receives $2.5 million for upgrades to key city buildings\n3 hours ago\nThe City of Eunice will see significant improvements as St. Landry Parish Government announced $2.5 million in funding for community upgrades. The money will enhance several key facilities in the area. The Louisiana Appropriations Bill has allocated $1.3 million for renovations of the Eunice City Hall and Eunice City Jail. In addition to the city hall and jail, $1.2 million from the appropriations bill and the St. Landry Historical Fund will help revitalize the historic Liberty Theatre.\n3",
